---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="put money on it" description="every friend group has that one guy who is 100% confident about everything.">
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-faint mb-4">
      <a href="/writing" class="text-accent hover:underline">writing</a> <span class="text-faint">/</span> put-money-on-it
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-normal animate-fade-up">put money on it</h1>

    <div class="essay mt-10 animate-fade-up delay-1">
      <p>every friend group has that one guy who’s somehow 100% confident about everything.</p>
      <hr class="my-12 border-border" />
      <p>until you ask if he wants to put money on it.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-spice">that’s basically why we’re building hot take.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-6 border-t border-border">
      <a href="/writing" class="text-accent hover:underline">← back to writing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .essay p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
